      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Al</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>Mg</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math>",
